cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or the derived data, please cite the software archive and the associated manuscript."
title: "Cyclone-driven disruption and recovery of vegetation photosynthesis in Southern Africa from TROPOMI SIF: analysis code and derived data"
abstract: >-
  R pipeline and derived datasets for an event-based analysis of tropical
  cyclone impacts on vegetation photosynthesis across Southern Africa
  (2018-2021), using TROPOMI solar-induced chlorophyll fluorescence within
  200 km storm-track corridors, with NIRvR and apparent fluorescence yield
  decomposition and PML-V2 GPP cross-comparison.
type: software
